title: Perplexity per KV type pair, K type / V type  (Qwythos 9B Q4_K_M, -ngl 25, 8 chunks of the repo docs)
args: -m /home/wrekt/.lmstudio/models/empero-ai/Qwythos-9B-Claude-Mythos-5-1M-GGUF/Qwythos-9B-Claude-Mythos-5-1M-Q4_K_M.gguf -f local-tune/results/ppl-corpus.txt -c 4096 -b 512 --chunks 8 -ngl 25 -t 6 -fa on
